<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Tuesday, August 27 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Tuesday	August    27   $63.22    unchanged</p>
<p>Monday	 August    26   $63.22    dn 0.06</p>
